sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor User as Nguoi dan (Citizen)
    participant UI as React Web App (Citizen Portal)
    participant Ctrl as WasteScanController
    participant Svc as WasteScanService
    participant Repo as MisclassifiedReportRepository
    participant DB as PostgreSQL (ApplicationDbContext)

    User->>+UI: 1. Bam 'Bao cao nhan dien sai', chon danh muc dung & ghi chu
    UI->>+Ctrl: 2. POST /api/v1/waste-scans/{scanId}/reports (Body: CreateReportRequestDto)
    Ctrl->>+Svc: 3. ReportMisclassificationAsync(scanId, userId, dto, ct)
    Svc->>+Repo: 4. AddAsync(MisclassifiedReport { status: 'Pending' })
    Repo->>+DB: 5. INSERT INTO misclassified_reports (scan_id, user_id, predicted_cat_id, user_suggested_cat_id, status='Pending')
    DB-->>-Repo: 6. 1 row affected (report_id)
    Repo-->>-Svc: 7. Return reportId
    Svc-->>-Ctrl: 8. Return reportId
    Ctrl-->>-UI: 9. 201 Created: ApiResponse<object> (MSG-CUR-01: Cam on ban da phan hoi!)
    UI-->>-User: 10. Hien thi thong bao cam on da dong gop du lieu cai thien AI
